    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "A jam jar is in the shape of a cylinder. It has a base radius of $3\\tfrac12$ cm and a height of 15 cm. Use $\\pi\\approx\\dfrac{22}{7}$ to find an approximate value for its volume.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$577.5\\text{ cm}^3$",
      "worked": "$3\\tfrac12=3.5$. Using the stated approximation, $V\\approx\\dfrac{22}{7}(3.5)^2(15)=577.5\\text{ cm}^3$.",
